<title>USA: Brown Disc restructures warrants.</title>
<headline>Brown Disc restructures warrants.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Disc Products Co Inc said it recalled three million warrants in a move to reduce the total number of shares outstanding on a fully-diluted basis.</p>
<p>The three million warrants were returned in exchange for 300,000 Rule 144 shares of common stock, it said.</p>
